  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc70:2.1.8": "“Should correct” renders <i lang='pi' translate='no'>vattabba</i>, the future passive participle of <i lang='pi' translate='no'>vadati</i>. For a discussion of the verb <i lang='pi' translate='no'>vadati</i> used in the sense of “correct”, see Appendix of Technical Terms. ",
